# Golden sources (committed): blender_create_pilot_demo.py, pilot_demo.blend,
# pilot_demo-standalone.iff.txt. Everything else here is regenerable, so a fresh clone has no
# pilot_demo.lev and `task build-level -- pilot_demo` alone stops; `task pilot-demo-level` runs both steps:
#   blender --background --python blender_create_pilot_demo.py   # snowgoons-blender.lev -> .blend + .lev + mesh .iff
#   bash ../../wftools/wf_blender/build_level_binary.sh pilot_demo  # -> ../pilot_demo*.iff
